es; filter tabs + plan tier + sorting).\n    - Compact action buttons preventing horizontal overflow/clipping (`[⚡ Pase]`, `[🆔 Credencial]`, `[👁️ Expediente]`, `[✏️ Editar]`, `[🔄 Renovar]`, `[🗑️ Eliminar]`).\n    - 3 view modes: Tabla Inteligente Pro, Fichas Pro (Grid), Mesa de Renovaciones (Follow-up Desk).\n    - Created `LEGENDS/src/components/clients/ClientCredentialModal.tsx` for digital VIP pass generation with Code 128 barcode.\n    - Appended `exportClientsToExcel` in `LEGENDS/src/utils/excelExport.ts`.\n    - Created standalone offline HTML: `CARTERA_CLIENTES_INTERFAZ_PRO.html` and launcher `ABRIR_CARTERA_CLIENTES_PRO.bat`.\n    - Copied badges, gym media, and audio WAV files from `repositorios/` into `LEGENDS/public/badges`, `LEGENDS/public/gym_media`, `LEGENDS/public/sounds`.\n    - Built and synchronized via `agy-node ./node_modules/vite/bin/vite.js build --emptyOutDir false` and `agy-node scripts/sync-dist.cjs`.\n- **In Progress / Inspected for the background image**:\n  - Found the exact source file corresponding to the user's screenshot: `LEGENDS/src/components/access/IndependentTerminalApp.tsx`.\n  - Also identified related standalone files: `LEGENDS/public/terminal.html`, `LEGENDS/public/Control_De_Acceso_Web.html`, `Control_De_Acceso_Web.html`, `ACCESO_WEB_FITNESS_LEGENDS.html`.\n  - Investigated `bgImage` state initialization in `IndependentTerminalApp.tsx` (lines 151–158):\n    ```ts\n    const [bgImage, setBgImage] = useState<string>(() => {\n      if (typeof window !== 'undefined' && localStorage.getItem('legends_terminal_bg_version') !== 'v10_clear_photo') {\n        localStorage.setItem('legends_terminal_bg_version', 'v10_clear_photo');\n        localStorage.setItem('legends_terminal_bg', gymBg);\n        return gymBg;\n      }\n      return localStorage.getItem('legends_terminal_bg') || gymBg;\n    });\n    ```\n  - Identified the imported assets in `IndependentTerminalApp.tsx`:\n    - `import gymBg from '../../assets/gym-background.jpg';`\n    - `import gymBgMotto from '../../assets/gym-background-motto.jpg';`\n    - `import modalGymBg from '../../assets/modal-gym-bg.jpg';`\n  - In `public/` and workspace root there are:\n    - `gym-background.jpg`\n    - `gym-background-club-8k.jpg`\n    - `gym-background-4k.jpg`\n    - `gym-background-1.jpg`\n    - `gym-background-2.jpg`\n    - `gym-dumbbell-background.jpg`\n    - `modal-gym-bg-hd.jpg`\n    - `wide_dumbbell_with_logo.jpg`\n    - `WhatsApp Image 2026-10-19 at 8.32.23 AM.jpeg` / `8.32.24 AM.jpeg`\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Findings\n- **Root Cause of Missing Background**:\n  - In `IndependentTerminalApp.tsx`, `bgImage` relies on `localStorage.getItem('legends_terminal_bg')`. If the stored value in `localStorage` was set to an old path or hash from previous Vite builds (e.g. `/assets/gym-background-C2ZRMS71.jpg` or an outdated relative path) that no longer exists after recompilation, the `<img>` tag fails to load, showing the broken image icon with alt `Fitness Legends Gym Background`.\n  - In addition, if `localStorage` has a stale key, it overrides the fallback `gymBg` imported by Vite!\n  - `IndependentTerminalApp.tsx` has `toggleBackground()` which toggles through background options. If the images in `localStorage` or `toggleBackground` point to missing URLs, it breaks.\n  - Also, `IndependentTerminalApp.tsx` has UTF-8 mojibake on Spanish characters (e.g. `InscripciÃ³n`, `DÃ­a`, `MEMBRESÃ A`).\n  - In `public/`, `gym-background.jpg` is the primary high-res gym wallpaper with the Legends neon logo on the gym wall.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Errors & Fixes\n- `npm run build` failed: `npm: The term 'npm' is not recognized`.\n  - *Fix*: Use `agy-node` (`C:\\Users\\andre\\AppData\\Roaming\\Antigravity\\bin\\agy-node.cmd`) which wraps `Antigravity.exe` with `ELECTRON_RUN_AS_NODE=1` (Node v24.21.0).\n- `vite build` failed: `EPERM, Permission denied: dist/assets`.\n  - *Fix*: Run with `--emptyOutDir false`: `agy-node ./node_modules/vite/bin/vite.js build --emptyOutDir false`.\n- PowerShell `Get-ChildItem -Filter` cannot take an array of filters.\n  - *Fix*: Pipe to `Where-Object { $_.Name -like ... }`.\n- Background image broken in terminal:\n  - Stale `localStorage` entry pointing to non-existent image paths or invalid relative asset resolution.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Active Context\n- Workspace: `c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\gym`\n- Core project: `LEGENDS` (Vite 8 + React 19 + Tailwind 3)\n- Launcher bats: `EJECUTAR_TERMINAL_ACCESO.bat`, `ABRIR_CONTROL_DE_ACCESO_WEB.bat`, `EJECUTAR_FITNESS_LEGENDS.bat`, `ABRIR_CARTERA_CLIENTES_PRO.bat`.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Next Steps\n1. **Fix Background Loading in `IndependentTerminalApp.tsx`**:\n   - Check `toggleBackground` and the list of available background images.\n   - Ensure the image list contains valid, verified assets (e.g., `gymBg`, `/gym-background.jpg`, `/gym-background-motto.jpg`, `/modal-gym-bg.jpg`, or Base64 / public asset paths).\n   - Add an `onError` handler on `<img src={bgImage} alt=\"Fitness Legends Gym Background\" />`:\n     ```tsx\n     onError={(e) => {\n       (e.currentTarget as HTMLImageElement).src = gymBg || '/gym-background.jpg';\n     }}\n     ```\n   - Reset or validate `localStorage.getItem('legends_terminal_bg')`: if the value is invalid or does not match current assets, reset it to `gymBg`.\n2. **Fix Encoding / Text on Terminal Cards**:\n   - Correct `InscripciÃ³n` to `Inscripción`, `DÃ­a` to `Día`, `MEMBRESÃ A` to `MEMBRESÍA` in `IndependentTerminalApp.tsx`.\n   - Restore the emoji or Lucide icons on badges (`💪`, `🎫`, `⚡`).\n3. **Check `TurnstileTerminal.tsx` and Standalone Files**:\n   - Apply the same robust background image fallback to `TurnstileTerminal.tsx` and `Control_De_Acceso_Web.html` / `terminal.html`.\n4. **Compile, Build and Verify**:\n   - Run `cd LEGENDS; agy-node ./node_modules/typescript/bin/tsc -b --noEmit`.\n   - Run `cd LEGENDS; agy-node ./node_modules/vite/bin/vite.js build --emptyOutDir false; agy-node scripts/sync-dist.cjs`.\n   - Verify that running the terminal renders the original gym background photo crisp and centered behind the cards with zero broken image icons.\n\n---\n\n### 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- Keep all communication concise and format all file references with Markdown file links (`file:///...`).\n- Preserve existing working code and functionality in `ClientList.tsx`, `GymContext`, and POS.\n- Ensure the gym background photo (\"Fitness Legends Gym\" with equipment/neon) loads reliably both offline and online without broken images.\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 4 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1792855762285_7c3e6755]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/andre/.gemini/antigravity/brain/cae5c059-1305-4baf-b23d-650f9838632f/.user_uploaded/media_1792855762285_7c3e6755.png\nLast Edited: 2026-10-24T15:30:31Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1792856707273_7e2218e9]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/andre/.gemini/antigravity/brain/cae5c059-1305-4baf-b23d-650f9838632f/.user_uploaded/media_1792856707273_7e2218e9.png\nLast Edited: 2026-10-24T15:45:11Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1792857125465_bc381733]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/andre/.gemini/antigravity/brain/cae5c059-1305-4baf-b23d-650f9838632f/.user_uploaded/media_1792857125465_bc381733.png\nLast Edited: 2026-10-24T15:52:14Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: cartera_clientes_gym_pro]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/andre/.gemini/antigravity/brain/cae5c059-1305-4baf-b23d-650f9838632f/cartera_clientes_gym_pro.html\nLast Edited: 2026-10-24T15:48:09Z\n\n# Conversation Logs\nStart with the compact transcript; if a step has `truncated_fields`, read only that specific line in `transcript_full.jsonl`:\n- `<appDataDir>/brain/<conversation-id>/.system_generated/logs/transcript.jsonl`\n- `<appDataDir>/brain/<conversation-id>/.system_generated/logs/transcript_full.jsonl`"}
